# Search Console HTML-tag verification token.
# GSC → Settings → Ownership verification → HTML tag → paste only the
# content="…" value, not the whole <meta> and not the DNS TXT record.
# Leave empty until you have a real token from your own GSC property.
# Loaded only at `vite build` into index.html — not exposed to the JS bundle.
GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
